From aa0ee1c1613353d376c2bd5a8eb07fe20e6e61fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 11:22:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] ci: run the existing migration manifest in the MySQL 8
 job

The 0005-0010 migration rehearsal (scripts/migration-manifest.ts) was only
run locally. Invoke it in the mysql-integration job against the disposable
MySQL 8 service so baseline->latest, rerun no-op, legacy data preservation,
fresh-schema parity and backfill idempotency are checked at the exact head,
and upload its manifest as an artifact. No script or threshold changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ADMGPDEiCj5xPwmjpf1nob
---
 .github/workflows/quality-gate.yml | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/quality-gate.yml b/.github/workflows/quality-gate.yml
index 2b4aaae..434565e 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/quality-gate.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/quality-gate.yml
@@ -185,6 +185,19 @@ jobs:
           TEST_DATABASE_URL: mysql://root:ci-only-root-password@127.0.0.1:3306
         run: pnpm test:mysql
 
+      - name: Migration manifest (baseline 0000-0004 -> latest, rerun no-op, data preservation, fresh-schema parity, backfill)
+        env:
+          TEST_DATABASE_URL: mysql://root:ci-only-root-password@127.0.0.1:3306
+        run: pnpm staging:migration-manifest
+
+      - name: Upload migration manifest
+        if: always()
+        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
+        with:
+          name: migration-manifest
+          path: reports/staging/runtime-migration-manifest.json
+          if-no-files-found: warn
+
       - name: Upload MySQL integration report
         if: always()
         uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
-- 
